Title:  Past, Present and Future

Long Title: We remember the past, and imagine the future.

Seq:    2.1

Display Seq: 16

Level:  3 - Topic

Class:  text

Timestamp: 20261010193248

Date Added: 2026-10-10 13:32:48 -0600

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:30:01 -0600

Body:

As a species, we have a highly developed ability to recall and share details about our pasts, and also to project ourselves into possible futures. 

And we can use [[sophisticated language]] to help us specify both past remembrances and future considerations in great detail, and to share these with others.
